  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Venezuela Earthquake Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed response aims to support crisis-affected populations in meeting their immediate health, nutrition, WASH and psychosocial needs while reducing the risks associated with displacement, disrupted services and deteriorating living conditions. Through a flexible delivery model combining mobile outreach, support to operational health facilities, and integrated WASH and site improvement interventions in collective shelters and affected communities, the programme will contribute to restoring access to essential life-saving services for women, children and other vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
